            'en': 'Walking a few steps toward the shores of expansive Itaipu Lake, we encountered calm, mirror-like waters. In this second frame, Pamela admires the lakeside horizon. Cool tree shade creates a peaceful frame highlighting her graceful profile and long hair resting down her back.\n\nItaipu Lake stretched like an inland freshwater sea. Pamela took a deep breath of crisp water air as our team captured a flawless angle highlighting her long dark hair falling naturally.'
